{"speciesId":701,"names":{"fr":"Brutalibré","es":"Hawlucha","en":"Hawlucha","ja":"ルチャブル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Malgré sa petite taille, son intelligence lui permet d’affronter sans trembler de grands Pokémon tels que les Mackogneur ou les Hariyama."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"A pesar de ser un Pokémon de pequeña estatura, su pericia en el combate le permite plantar cara a Pokémon como Machamp o Hariyama."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Although its body is small, its proficient fighting skills enable it to keep up with big bruisers like Machamp and Hariyama."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体格は 小柄だが カイリキーや ハリテヤマなど 大きな ポケモンと 互角に 戦う テクニシャン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il utilise ses ailes pour contrôler avec précision sa posture en vol. Ses attaques aériennes sont difficiles à parer."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Controla su posición en el aire con las alas. Lanza ataques desde gran altura que resultan difíciles de evitar."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"With its wings, it controls its position in the air. It likes to attack from above, a maneuver that is difficult to defend against."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"翼を 使い 空中で 姿勢を コントロール。防ぎにくい 頭上から 攻撃を 仕掛ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Malgré sa petite taille, son intelligence lui permet d’affronter sans trembler de grands Pokémon tels que les Mackogneur ou les Hariyama."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A pesar de ser un Pokémon de pequeña estatura, su pericia en el combate le permite plantar cara a Pokémon como Machamp o Hariyama."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Although its body is small, its proficient fighting skills enable it to keep up with big bruisers like Machamp and Hariyama."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体格は 小柄だが カイリキーや ハリテヤマなど 大きな ポケモンと 互角に 戦う テクニシャン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il utilise ses ailes pour contrôler avec précision sa posture en vol. Ses attaques aériennes sont difficiles à parer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Controla su posición en el aire con las alas. Lanza ataques desde gran altura que resultan difíciles de evitar."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"With its wings, it controls its position in the air. It likes to attack from above, a maneuver that is difficult to defend against."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"翼を 使い 空中で 姿勢を コントロール。防ぎにくい 頭上から 攻撃を 仕掛ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il terrasse ses adversaires grâce à sa vitesse, mais se pavane tant avant de lancer sa botte secrète qu’il se retrouve parfois en difficulté."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Deja atónito al rival con sus rápidos ataques, pero se luce tanto antes de dar el golpe definitivo que a veces sale mal parado."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It overwhelms opponents with quick moves, but sometimes it showboats for too long when it’s using a special move and gets itself into a pinch."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"素早い技で 相手を 圧倒。 必殺技を 放つ アピールが 長すぎて ピンチに陥ることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il combat ses adversaires en sautillant pour se retrouver dans leur angle mort. Il maîtrise de formidables techniques de clés articulaires."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Con sus ágiles saltos y su juego de piernas, permanece siempre en el punto ciego del rival. Es un experto en llaves inmovilizadoras."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"In combat, Hawlucha leaps nimbly about, taking advantage of its opponents’ blind spots. It’s also skilled at using superb submission holds."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"軽やかな ジャンプで 相手の 死角に まわりつつ 戦う。 華麗な 関節技も 得意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il utilise des tactiques basées sur son agilité pour fatiguer son adversaire, et termine le combat par une magnifique frappe décisive."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se vale de su agilidad para minar las fuerzas del rival y, una vez extenuado, remata el combate ejecutando una técnica formidable."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It drives its opponents to exhaustion with its agile maneuvers, then ends the fight with a flashy finishing move."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"身軽さを 活かした 戦法で 相手の 体力を 奪ってから 華麗な 大技を 決める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il prend toujours la pose avant de donner le coup de grâce à son adversaire. Certains en profitent pour contre-attaquer."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Siempre se exhibe con alguna pose justo antes de propinar el golpe de gracia, momento que algunos rivales aprovechan para contraatacar."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It always strikes a pose before going for its finishing move. Sometimes opponents take advantage of that time to counterattack."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"とどめの 大技を 出す 前は かならず ポーズを 決める。 その 隙に 反撃される こともある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":701,"moves":[{"name":"karate-chop","learns":[[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",4]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[15,"level-up",60],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",60],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",60],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",60],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",40],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",40],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",8],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",4],[25,"level-up",4]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,